			<div class="elementor-author-box__text">
									<div >
						<h4 class="elementor-author-box__name">
							B. Millar						</h4>
					</div>
				
									<div class="elementor-author-box__bio">
						I'm the founder of History Crunch, which I first began in 2015 with a small team of like-minded professionals.  I have an Education Degree with a focus in Social Studies education.  I spent nearly 15 years teaching history, geography and economics in secondary classrooms to thousands of students. Now I use my time and passion researching, writing and thinking about history education for today's students and teachers.					</div>
				
