							<div class="elementor-posts-container elementor-posts elementor-posts--skin-cards elementor-grid" role="list">
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-6868 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-world-war-ii category-british-history tag-british-history tag-history tag-world-war-ii" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://historycrunch.com/blitz-in-world-war-ii/" tabindex="-1" target="_blank"><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img width="300" height="169" src="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Blitz-in-World-War-II-300x169.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-12169" alt="Blitz in World War II" decoding="async" srcset="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Blitz-in-World-War-II-300x169.jpg 300w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Blitz-in-World-War-II-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Blitz-in-World-War-II-768x432.jpg 768w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Blitz-in-World-War-II.jpg 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__badge">World War II</div>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://historycrunch.com/blitz-in-world-war-ii/" target=&quot;_blank&quot;>
				Blitz in World War II: A Detailed Summary			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>The Blitz was one of the most important bombing campaigns of World War II and became a symbol of both destruction and British endurance. This article details the history and significance of the Blitz in World War II.</p>
		</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-3318 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-holocaust category-genocide category-world-war-ii tag-genocide tag-history tag-holocaust tag-nazi-germany tag-world-war-ii" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://historycrunch.com/liberation-of-the-camps/" tabindex="-1" target="_blank"><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img loading="lazy" width="300" height="169" src="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Auschwitz-Holocaust-300x169.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-5240" alt="Auschwitz Holocaust" decoding="async" srcset="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Auschwitz-Holocaust-300x169.jpg 300w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Auschwitz-Holocaust-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Auschwitz-Holocaust-768x432.jpg 768w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Auschwitz-Holocaust.jpg 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__badge">Holocaust</div>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://historycrunch.com/liberation-of-the-camps/" target=&quot;_blank&quot;>
				Liberation of the Camps: A Detailed Summary			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>When the Allied forces of World War II liberated Europe from Nazi control, they also made terrible discoveries of the atrocities of the Holocaust and the system of concentration and death camps. This article details the history and significance of the liberation of these camps at the end of World War II.</p>
		</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-3579 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-world-war-ii tag-american-history tag-history tag-world-war-ii tag-ww2-battles" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://historycrunch.com/battle-of-iwo-jima-in-world-war-ii/" tabindex="-1" target="_blank"><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img loading="lazy" width="300" height="169" src="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Battle-of-Iwo-Jima-in-World-War-II-300x169.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-12182" alt="Battle of Iwo Jima in World War II" decoding="async" srcset="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Battle-of-Iwo-Jima-in-World-War-II-300x169.jpg 300w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Battle-of-Iwo-Jima-in-World-War-II-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Battle-of-Iwo-Jima-in-World-War-II-768x432.jpg 768w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Battle-of-Iwo-Jima-in-World-War-II.jpg 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__badge">World War II</div>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://historycrunch.com/battle-of-iwo-jima-in-world-war-ii/" target=&quot;_blank&quot;>
				Battle of Iwo Jima in World War II: A Detailed Summary			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>The Battle of Iwo Jima had some of the fiercest fighting of World War II in the Pacific. This article details the history and significance of the Battle of Iwo Jima in World War II.</p>
		</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-891 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-world-war-i category-black-history category-world-war-ii tag-history tag-world-war-i" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://historycrunch.com/harlem-hellfighters/" tabindex="-1" target="_blank"><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img loading="lazy" width="300" height="169" src="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Harlem-Hellfighters-World-War-I-300x169.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-1581" alt="Watercolor painting of African American soldiers of the 369th Infantry Regiment marching in helmets during World War I" decoding="async" srcset="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Harlem-Hellfighters-World-War-I-300x169.jpg 300w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Harlem-Hellfighters-World-War-I-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Harlem-Hellfighters-World-War-I-768x432.jpg 768w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Harlem-Hellfighters-World-War-I.jpg 1500w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__badge">World War I</div>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://historycrunch.com/harlem-hellfighters/" target=&quot;_blank&quot;>
				Harlem Hellfighters: A Detailed Summary			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>The Harlem Hellfighters, officially known as the 369th Infantry Regiment, were an African American infantry unit in World War I, renowned for their valor and resilience in the face of adversity, breaking down racial barriers and earning widespread recognition for their bravery.</p>
		</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-6672 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-world-war-ii category-nazi-germany tag-history tag-world-war-ii" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://historycrunch.com/axis-powers-of-world-war-ii/" tabindex="-1" target="_blank"><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img loading="lazy" width="300" height="169" src="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Axis-Powers-of-World-War-II-300x169.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-12278" alt="Axis Powers of World War II" decoding="async" srcset="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Axis-Powers-of-World-War-II-300x169.jpg 300w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Axis-Powers-of-World-War-II-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Axis-Powers-of-World-War-II-768x432.jpg 768w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Axis-Powers-of-World-War-II.jpg 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__badge">World War II</div>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://historycrunch.com/axis-powers-of-world-war-ii/" target=&quot;_blank&quot;>
				Axis Powers of World War II: A Detailed Summary			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>The Axis Powers of World War II were Nazi Germany, fascist Italy and Imperial Japan. Their rise, expansion and defeat are important in understanding the significance of World War II. This article details the history and importance of the Axis Powers of World War II.</p>
		</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</article>
				<article class="elementor-post elementor-grid-item post-3428 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-nazi-germany category-world-war-ii tag-history tag-nazi-germany tag-world-war-ii" role="listitem">
			<div class="elementor-post__card">
				<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://historycrunch.com/annexation-of-austria-by-nazi-germany/" tabindex="-1" target="_blank"><div class="elementor-post__thumbnail"><img loading="lazy" width="300" height="169" src="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Annexation-of-Austria-by-Nazi-Germany-300x169.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-5386" alt="Annexation of Austria by Nazi Germany" decoding="async" srcset="https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Annexation-of-Austria-by-Nazi-Germany-300x169.jpg 300w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Annexation-of-Austria-by-Nazi-Germany-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Annexation-of-Austria-by-Nazi-Germany-768x432.jpg 768w, https://historycrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Annexation-of-Austria-by-Nazi-Germany.jpg 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></div></a>
				<div class="elementor-post__badge">Nazi Germany</div>
				<div class="elementor-post__text">
				<h3 class="elementor-post__title">
			<a href="https://historycrunch.com/annexation-of-austria-by-nazi-germany/" target=&quot;_blank&quot;>
				Annexation of Austria by Nazi Germany: A Detailed Summary			</a>
		</h3>
				<div class="elementor-post__excerpt">
			<p>The Nazi Germany annexation of Austria was an important event in the buildup to World War II. This article details the history and significance of the annexation of Austria.</p>
		</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</article>
